### 5.5 DELETE Rack 1
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/organization-service/api/racks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5.6 DELETE Site 1
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/organization-service/api/organization/sites/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

